  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e7a5919ff3dd728499db3d01b9c7d9c4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level3IntroBeforeTrainSequence
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - text: The next day...
    speakerName: ' '
    portrait: {fileID: 10917, guid: 0000000000000000f000000000000000, type: 0}
    useCustomRevealSpeed: 0
    revealLettersPerSecond: 0
    interactionRequirement:
      enabled: 0
      allowedInteractionIds: []
      requiredInteractionCount: 1
  - text: Looks like you've made it to another day.
    speakerName: Sheriff
    portrait: {fileID: -7307842283543146795, guid: 8e858e9d9926f124392468c068f061d7, type: 3}
    useCustomRevealSpeed: 0
    revealLettersPerSecond: 0
    interactionRequirement:
      enabled: 0
      allowedInteractionIds: []
      requiredInteractionCount: 1
  - text: The application higher ups have decided that a range of destination ports
      will be open from now on. This means trains can access more than just the one
      port like before.
    speakerName: Sheriff
    portrait: {fileID: -7307842283543146795, guid: 8e858e9d9926f124392468c068f061d7, type: 3}
    useCustomRevealSpeed: 0
    revealLettersPerSecond: 0
    interactionRequirement:
      enabled: 0
      allowedInteractionIds: []
      requiredInteractionCount: 1
  - text: This also means that we're vulnerable to port scanning, so make sure to
      keep an eye out! If you see trains arriving at sequential destination ports,
      that's cause for suspicion!
    speakerName: Sheriff
    portrait: {fileID: -7307842283543146795, guid: 8e858e9d9926f124392468c068f061d7, type: 3}
    useCustomRevealSpeed: 0
    revealLettersPerSecond: 0
    interactionRequirement:
      enabled: 0
      allowedInteractionIds: []
      requiredInteractionCount: 1
  - text: Good luck!
    speakerName: Sheriff
    portrait: {fileID: -7307842283543146795, guid: 8e858e9d9926f124392468c068f061d7, type: 3}
    useCustomRevealSpeed: 0
    revealLettersPerSecond: 0
    interactionRequirement:
      enabled: 0
      allowedInteractionIds: []
      requiredInteractionCount: 1
